cff-version: 1.2.0
title: multiphysics field identifiability (v0)
message: If you use this software or its results, please cite it.
type: software
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-09-14
repository-code: "https://github.com/tue-bmd/multiphysics-ultrasound-models"
url: "https://github.com/tue-bmd/multiphysics-ultrasound-models/tree/main/studies/02-multiphysics-field-identifiability"
license: BSD-3-Clause
abstract: >-
  A v0 study of parameter identifiability from idealized mechanical and
  contrast-transport fields. Profile likelihoods and posterior sampling compare
  independent, constitutively coupled, and network-informed parameter models
  across nine synthetic parameter settings.
keywords:
  - quantitative ultrasound
  - inverse problems
  - identifiability
  - uncertainty quantification
  - contrast-enhanced ultrasound
  - shear wave elastography
